                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "4/10 - somewhat playable, \nvery uncomfortable.\n\nOn Quest 3 to play, \nMust use 'Air Link' for the proper control, \nbut the 'audio to headset' won't work\nUse Steam VR or VD streamer, \nyou're stuck to 'HTC Vive control'.\n\nOf the 3 locomotion options, only last one is viable.\nSharp turn is stuck to 90 degrees, so use 'Smooth Turn'. \nput movement and turn speed to max helps a bit.\n\nYou can, use 'game-pad' and VR head pointing, \nbut then everything becomes a chore, not fun, just uncomfortable.",
